Rāma asks brothers forest austerities --- Kumbhakarṇa endures five fires rain cold water ten millennia --- Vibhīṣaṇa stands one-footed sun-gazing ten millennia as celestials celebrate --- Rāvaṇa fasts ten millennia offering nine heads to fire --- Brahmā comes with gods to grant wished boon --- Rāvaṇa wins immunity save men and restored heads --- Vibhīṣaṇa wins abiding dharma and immortality --- Gods beg delusion for world-terrifying Kumbhakarṇa --- Sarasvatī enters mouth bending Kumbhakarṇa tongue to sleep --- Kumbhakarṇa rues deluded sleep-boon as boon-proud brothers settle in Ślēṣmātaka wood